{"id": "b01", "type": "condition", "question": "太保阿基米德如果查出甲状腺癌，是按重疾赔还是按轻症赔？", "answer": "不能仅凭“甲状腺癌”确定，需看TNM分期：TNM分期为Ⅰ期的甲状腺癌不属于“恶性肿瘤——重度”，不在重大疾病保障范围内 [C5]；它属于“恶性肿瘤——轻度”特指的六项之一，可按轻症疾病赔付 [C6]。若不是上述情形且符合“恶性肿瘤——重度”定义，则按重大疾病赔付 [C5][C7]。轻症疾病保险金按基本保险金额的30%给付 [C1]；重大疾病保险金按基本保险金额、现金价值、已支付保险费总额三项中金额较大者给付 [C7]。", "refused": false, "parse_ok": true, "finish_reason": "stop", "context": [{"cid": "C1", "chunk_ids": ["cpic_archimedes_2025::-::2.4.2#0", "cpic_archimedes_2025::-::2.4.2#1", "cpic_archimedes_2025::-::2.4.2#2"]}, {"cid": "C2", "chunk_ids": ["cpic_archimedes_2025::-::11.1#0"]}, {"cid": "C3", "chunk_ids": ["cpic_archimedes_2025::-::13.1#0"]}, {"cid": "C4", "chunk_ids": ["cpic_archimedes_2025::-::2.6#0"]}, {"cid": "C5", "chunk_ids": ["cpic_archimedes_2025::-::11.1.1#0"]}, {"cid": "C6", "chunk_ids": ["cpic_archimedes_2025::-::13.1.1#0", "cpic_archimedes_2025::-::13.1.1#1"]}, {"cid": "C7", "chunk_ids": ["cpic_archimedes_2025::-::2.4.1#0", "cpic_archimedes_2025::-::2.4.1#1", "cpic_archimedes_2025::-::2.4.1#2"]}, {"cid": "C8", "chunk_ids": ["cpic_archimedes_2025::-::guide-p1#1", "cpic_archimedes_2025::-::guide-p1#2"]}, {"cid": "C9", "chunk_ids": ["cpic_archimedes_2025::-::13.2#0"]}, {"cid": "C10", "chunk_ids": ["cpic_archimedes_2025::-::2.4.6#0", "cpic_archimedes_2025::-::2.4.6#1"]}], "context_chars": 7900, "relevant_in_context": ["C5", "C6"], "cited": ["C5", "C6", "C7", "C1"], "invalid_citations": [], "cited_relevant": ["C5", "C6"], "must_include": ["TNM Ⅰ期甲状腺癌属于轻症（恶性肿瘤——轻度）", "不属于重度恶性肿瘤", "轻症责任属于可选保障1，未投保则不赔；Ⅱ期及以上甲状腺癌按重度"], "must_not_include_hits": [], "subquestions": ["太保阿基米德 甲状腺癌 疾病定义 重度", "太保阿基米德 甲状腺癌 疾病定义 轻度", "太保阿基米德 保险责任 重大疾病 轻症疾病"], "split_usage": {"prompt": 334, "completion": 55, "reasoning": 0}, "usage": {"prompt": 5850, "completion": 1287, "reasoning": 1090}, "seconds": 15.9, "cached": false}
{"id": "b02", "type": "condition", "question": "泰康惠嘉保要是喝了酒开车出事，得了重病还能赔吗？", "answer": "若被保险人因“酒后驾驶”导致发生本合同定义的重大疾病，我们不承担给付重大疾病保险金的责任 [C1]。条款中“酒后驾驶”指经检测或者鉴定，发生保险事故时每百毫升血液中的酒精含量达到或者超过一定标准，公安机关交通管理部门依据《道路交通安全法》的规定认定为饮酒后驾驶或醉酒后驾驶 [C1]。酒后驾驶属于责任免除第（5）项，因第（5）项导致重大疾病时，合同终止，向您退还本合同终止时的现金价值 [C1]。因此，喝了酒开车出事并因此得了重病，不能获得重大疾病保险金，但可退还合同终止时的现金价值 [C1]。", "refused": false, "parse_ok": true, "finish_reason": "stop", "context": [{"cid": "C1", "chunk_ids": ["taikang_huijiabao_2026::-::2.1#0", "taikang_huijiabao_2026::-::2.1#1", "taikang_huijiabao_2026::-::2.1#2"]}, {"cid": "C2", "chunk_ids": ["taikang_huijiabao_2026::-::附件一#0", "taikang_huijiabao_2026::-::附件一#1", "taikang_huijiabao_2026::-::附件一#2", "taikang_huijiabao_2026::-::附件一#8", "taikang_huijiabao_2026::-::附件一#9", "taikang_huijiabao_2026::-::附件一#10", "taikang_huijiabao_2026::-::附件一#31", "taikang_huijiabao_2026::-::附件一#32", "taikang_huijiabao_2026::-::附件一#33"]}, {"cid": "C3", "chunk_ids": ["taikang_huijiabao_2026::-::4.4#0"]}, {"cid": "C4", "chunk_ids": ["taikang_huijiabao_2026::-::1.5#0", "taikang_huijiabao_2026::-::1.5#1", "taikang_huijiabao_2026::-::1.5#2"]}, {"cid": "C5", "chunk_ids": ["taikang_huijiabao_2026::-::4.3#0"]}, {"cid": "C6", "chunk_ids": ["taikang_huijiabao_2026::-::8.1#0", "taikang_huijiabao_2026::-::8.1#1"]}, {"cid": "C7", "chunk_ids": ["taikang_huijiabao_2026::-::4.1#0"]}, {"cid": "C8", "chunk_ids": ["taikang_huijiabao_2026::-::guide-p2#0"]}, {"cid": "C9", "chunk_ids": ["taikang_huijiabao_2026::-::7.2#0"]}, {"cid": "C10", "chunk_ids": ["taikang_huijiabao_2026::-::1.4#0", "taikang_huijiabao_2026::-::1.4#1"]}], "context_chars": 11047, "relevant_in_context": ["C1"], "cited": ["C1"], "invalid_citations": [], "cited_relevant": ["C1"], "must_include": ["酒后驾驶导致的属于责任免除，不赔"], "must_not_include_hits": [], "subquestions": ["泰康惠嘉保 责任免除 酒后驾驶", "泰康惠嘉保 疾病定义 重度", "泰康惠嘉保 保险金的申请与给付"], "split_usage": {"prompt": 331, "completion": 43, "reasoning": 0}, "usage": {"prompt": 7659, "completion": 1222, "reasoning": 1022}, "seconds": 15.5, "ca