{"id": "b13", "type": "compare", "question": "泰康惠嘉保和太保阿基米德，出事以后多长时间内要通知保险公司？", "answer": "泰康惠嘉保2026：您或者受益人知道保险事故发生后应当在10 日内通知保险公司[C2]。太保阿基米德（2025）：您、被保险人或受益人知道保险事故发生后应当在10 日内通知保险公司[C1]。比较：两款产品关于保险事故通知的时限相同，均为知道保险事故发生后10 日内[C1][C2]。", "refused": false, "parse_ok": true, "finish_reason": "stop", "context": [{"cid": "C1", "chunk_ids": ["cpic_archimedes_2025::-::3.2#0"]}, {"cid": "C2", "chunk_ids": ["taikang_huijiabao_2026::-::4.2#0"]}, {"cid": "C3", "chunk_ids": ["taikang_huijiabao_2026::-::8.1#0", "taikang_huijiabao_2026::-::8.1#1"]}, {"cid": "C4", "chunk_ids": ["cpic_archimedes_2025::-::3.6#0"]}, {"cid": "C5", "chunk_ids": ["taikang_huijiabao_2026::-::guide-p2#0"]}, {"cid": "C6", "chunk_ids": ["cpic_archimedes_2025::-::8.2#0"]}, {"cid": "C7", "chunk_ids": ["cpic_archimedes_2025::-::9.6#0"]}, {"cid": "C8", "chunk_ids": ["taikang_huijiabao_2026::-::1.3#0"]}, {"cid": "C9", "chunk_ids": ["cpic_archimedes_2025::-::guide-p1#0", "cpic_archimedes_2025::-::guide-p1#1", "cpic_archimedes_2025::-::guide-p1#2"]}, {"cid": "C10", "chunk_ids": ["taikang_huijiabao_2026::-::1.4#0", "taikang_huijiabao_2026::-::1.4#1"]}, {"cid": "C11", "chunk_ids": ["taikang_huijiabao_2026::-::1.1#0"]}], "context_chars": 4625, "relevant_in_context": ["C1", "C2"], "cited": ["C2", "C1"], "invalid_citations": [], "cited_relevant": ["C2", "C1"], "must_include": ["两款都是知道保险事故后10日内通知"], "must_not_include_hits": [], "subquestions": ["泰康惠嘉保 保险事故通知 通知期限", "太保阿基米德 保险事故通知 通知期限"], "split_usage": {"prompt": 334, "completion": 34, "reasoning": 0}, "usage": {"prompt": 3717, "completion": 472, "reasoning": 346}, "seconds": 7.6, "cached": false}
